":"tv313996","tmdb_id":313996,"content_type":"series","title":"المقعد الأخير","title_en":"Al Meqaad El Akheer","title_fr":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"من قلب الأزقة المتواضعة إلى أروقة النخبة الأرستقراطية، تنطلق 'يارا' في رحلة محفوفة بالأشواك بعد نيلها منحة دراسية في أرقى صروح البلاد. وبينما كانت تتوقع مستقبلاً مشرقاً، تصطدم بجدران من التنمر والطبقية والضغوط الاجتماعية التي تحاول كسر روحها. ومع ذلك، تأبى يارا الانكسار، محولة كل طعنة إلى درجة في سلم المجد، لتثبت للجميع أن النجاح الاستثنائي لا يُصنع بالمال والنفوذ، بل بإرادة صلبة لا تعرف المستحيل.","description_en":"After obtaining a scholarship at the country's top universities, Yara's journey takes her from the streets to the elite. Though she expected a bright future, bullying, classism, and societal pressures try to shatter her spirit. Yara refuses to give up, turning every setback into a stride toward triumph, proving that great achievement is founded not on money or power, but on an unwavering resolve.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18WGdjTY6UDf8Go82IPImDXCISU.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AaVoZGx1cN9eMeCyRZoPxeJbpl3.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"2026","release_date":"2026-02-18","runtime_minutes":null,"status":"Ended","country":"سوريا","language":"العربية","genres":["دراما"],"genre_keys":["drama"],"similar":["tv247718","tv71712","tv5920","tv259909","tv56570","tv76773","tv2288","tv4607"],"director":"حسام سلامة","cast":[{"name":"Jay Abdo","character":"actors","profile_image":null},{"name":"Yara Sabri","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A6lBU1mNd3gY7VOKxFrySPSJEVn.jpg"},{"name":"محمد خاوندي","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8YRLb4OH7x33Mb3Ffi49wiF7xWp.jpg"},{"name":"Asima Youssef","character":null,"profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rDK1KuEh05fWmT7spYxll99A2Tr.jpg"},{"name":"Massah Al Jammal","character":null,"